{title: Pardesi Pardesi Jaana Nahi}
{artist: Udit Narayan Alka Yagnik Nadeem Shravan}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G],        Main yeh nahi kehti ki pyaar mat karna
[A] [G],        Kisi ajnabi ka magar aitbar mat karna
[G] [Em],        Pardesi pardesi jana nahi
[C] [D] [G],        Mujhe chhod ke, mujhe chhod ke
[G] [C] [G],        Pardesi mere yaara vaada nibhana
[G] [Dm] [G],        Mujhe yaad rakhna kahin bhool na jana
[G] [Am],        Maine tumko chaha tumse pyaar kiya
[C] [G],        Sab kuchh tum pe yaar apna vaar diya
[G] [Am],        Ban gayi jogan maine preet ka jog liya
[C] [G],        Na socha, na samjha dil ka rog liya
[G] [C] [G],        Pardesi mere yaara laut ke aana
[G] [Dm] [G],        Tum yaad rakhna kahin bhool na jana
[G] [Am],        Har pal meri yaad tumhein tadpaayegi
[C] [G],        Main jaagoonga neend tumhein na aayegi
[G] [Am],        Chhod ke aise haal mein jo tum jaaoge,
[C] [G],        Sach kehta hoon jaan pachhtaoge
[G] [C] [G],        Pardesi mere yaara mujhe na rulana
[G] [Dm] [G],        Tum yaad rakhna kahin bhool na jana
